{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo Dot feels like a useful addition because voice control fits how I use my Fire TV devices and adds a different function.",
    "The WYZE camera feels relevant because I have used home security cameras and would consider adding another indoor view."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Another Fire TV Stick 4K fits my viewing interests, but I already have one and a Fire TV television; the HD stick offers even less reason to buy.",
    "The memory, storage devices, and cable need a specific compatible device or upgrade need that I have not identified. Earbuds also do not address my current home viewing or security interests.",
    "A Wi-Fi extender could support my connected devices, but owning those devices does not mean I have a coverage problem."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My electronics purchases seem to have been treated as interest in computer parts and accessories generally.",
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as a reason to recommend more streaming sticks, even when they duplicate what I own or offer lower resolution."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "I am more interested in additions that provide a useful new function, such as voice control or another camera view, than replacements for equipment I already have.",
    "Accessory compatibility and a concrete current need matter to me; a broad connection to cameras or Fire TV is not enough to make an accessory useful."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my home viewing and security interests but stretched them into duplicate devices and accessories without a clear need."
}"}
